# Manifold level 8
# The arena (stage 4g), the shooter's pieces: a square walled round, cover to take, a dart and a bolt on
# their racks where you come in, and three guards with darts walking their beats at the far end. Bring
# all three down. Best in first person: `view.camera first`.
title The arena
spawn 0 1 10
facing 0 0 -1

box 0 -0.5 0     12 0.5 12   color #6f6a62  name floor
box -12.2 2 0    0.2 2 12    color #5a544c
box 12.2 2 0     0.2 2 12    color #5a544c
box 0 2 12.2     12.4 2 0.2  color #5a544c
box 0 2 -12.2    12.4 2 0.2  color #5a544c

# Cover: low walls to crouch behind, and pillars.
box -5 0.6 3     1.5 0.6 0.3  color #7a6a52  affords cover
box 5 0.6 3      1.5 0.6 0.3  color #7a6a52  affords cover
box 0 0.6 -2     2 0.6 0.3    color #7a6a52  affords cover
box -6 1.5 -6    0.6 1.5 0.6  color #5a544c  affords cover
box 6 1.5 -6     0.6 1.5 0.6  color #5a544c  affords cover

# The racks: a dart (1) and a bolt (2).
sensor weapon  -2 0.5 8.5   0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 1  name dart_rack
sensor weapon  2 0.5 8.5    0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 2  name bolt_rack

# Three guards with darts, each on its beat.
route west  -8 0 -9  -8 0 -3
route mid   -3 0 -9  3 0 -9
route east  8 0 -9   8 0 -3
sensor gunner  -8 1 -9   0.3 0.8 0.3  kind 1
sensor gunner  0 1 -9    0.3 0.8 0.3  kind 1
sensor gunner  8 1 -9    0.3 0.8 0.3  kind 1

sensor checkpoint  0 1 10   1 1 1
sensor plate       0 0.8 10  1 0.8 1  name arrival

signal start    zone arrival
signal cleared

scene go when start  dojo.who.master:dojo.story.arena
objective clear when cleared say dojo.story.clear
